    <title type='text'>SEO Tool (Search Engine Optimization)</title>
    <content type='html'>
                &lt;div class=&quot;kg-card-markdown&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;!-- &lt;span class=&quot;table-of-contents-list&quot;&gt;Jekyll 따라하기의 목차입니다.&lt;/span&gt;
